[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/comments/1773804673","html_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/issues/4947#issuecomment-1773804673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/4947","id":1773804673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOELj1_s5puhyB","user":{"login":"jussisaurio","id":22619982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio","html_url":"https://github.com/jussisaurio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-21T14:13:54Z","updated_at":"2023-10-21T14:13:54Z","body":"There indeed seems to be an error in the way `input` is propagated forward when using multiple standalone middlewares -- i.e. they are not merged properly. I'll try to look into it","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/comments/1773804673/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/comments/1773808178","html_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/issues/4947#issuecomment-1773808178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/4947","id":1773808178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOELj1_s5puioy","user":{"login":"jussisaurio","id":22619982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjE5OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22619982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio","html_url":"https://github.com/jussisaurio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jussisaurio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-21T14:24:47Z","updated_at":"2023-10-24T15:43:03Z","body":"To clarify @ahkhanjani , is this something along the lines of what you want?\r\n\r\n```ts\r\ntest('standalone middlewares -- inputs are merged properly when using multiple standalone middlewares', () => {\r\n  const t = initTRPC.create();\r\n  const schemaA = z.object({ valueA: z.string() });\r\n  const schemaB = z.object({ valueB: z.string() });\r\n\r\n  const valueAUppercaserMiddleware = experimental_standaloneMiddleware<{\r\n    input: z.infer<typeof schemaA>;\r\n  }>().create((opts) => {\r\n    // The type-safe input\r\n    const { input } = opts; // { valueA: string }\r\n\r\n    // Create a new context value from the input...\r\n\r\n    return opts.next({\r\n      ctx: { valueAUppercase: input.valueA.toUpperCase() },\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  const setQuizAnswerMiddleware = experimental_standaloneMiddleware<{\r\n    input: z.infer<typeof schemaB>;\r\n  }>().create((opts) => {\r\n    return opts.next({\r\n      ctx: { quizAnswer: opts.input.valueB },\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  const schemasMerge = schemaA.merge(schemaB);\r\n\r\n  t.procedure\r\n    .input(schemasMerge)\r\n    .use(valueAUppercaserMiddleware)\r\n    .use(setQuizAnswerMiddleware)\r\n    .query(\r\n      ({ input: { valueA, valueB }, ctx: { valueAUppercase, quizAnswer } }) =>\r\n        `valueA: ${valueA}, valueB: ${valueB}, valueAUppercase: ${valueAUppercase}, quizAnswer: ${quizAnswer}`,\r\n    );\r\n});\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/comments/1773808178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/comments/1773836305","html_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/issues/4947#issuecomment-1773836305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/4947","id":1773836305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOELj1_s5pupgR","user":{"login":"ahkhanjani","id":72540492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTQwNDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72540492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani","html_url":"https://github.com/ahkhanjani","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/received_events","type":"User","