"2023-10-21T16:34:54Z","body":"> Can you give an example use case with pseudocode?\r\n\r\nSomething like this:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nconst nameSchema = z.object({ firstName: z.string(), lastName: z.string() });\r\n\r\nconst computeFullName = arbitrary_isolatedMiddleware().input(nameSchema).create((opts) => {\r\n  const { firstName, lastName } = opts;\r\n  const fullName = firstName + ' ' + lastName;\r\n  return opts.next({ ctx: { fullName } });\r\n});\r\n\r\nconst otherSchema = z.object({ greetingValue: z.enum(['Hello', 'Goodbye']) });\r\n\r\npublicProcedure.input(otherSchema).use(computeFullName)\r\n  // The `input` object doesn't include `firstName` or `lastName`.\r\n  .query(({ input: { greetingValue }, ctx: { fullName } }): => (`${greetingValue} ${fullName}`);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe React code (with TanStack Query):\r\n\r\n```ts\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// Here, we require all values.\r\nconst { data } = api.(...).useQuery({ greetingValue: 'Hello', firstName: 'A', lastName: 'B' })\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/comments/1773848512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/comments/1773849057","html_url":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/issues/4947#issuecomment-1773849057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trpc/trpc/issues/4947","id":1773849057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOELj1_s5pusnh","user":{"login":"ahkhanjani","id":72540492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTQwNDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72540492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani","html_url":"https://github.com/ahkhanjani","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahkhanjani/gists{